Description: native CLI for Payload Markdown Docs
 pmdocs is the system-level native command-line interface for
 payload-markdown-docs. It provides docs sync tooling for projects that do not
 want to install the npm package locally.
 .
 This package contains the native offline CLI workflow and bundled Codex skill
 data. Network push, auth, and signing commands remain in the npm CLI until
 future native port phases.
